# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers (copied to .open-next/assets).
# /sw.js is NOT a static asset any more: app/sw.js/route.ts serves it with the
# build id stamped in and sets its own no-cache headers.
# Statiske filer (/_next/static, ikon, manifest) går forbi Worker-koden og får
# derfor IKKE next.config.ts sine headers. HSTS gjelder hele opprinnelsen, så den
# må følge med her også. Ingen includeSubDomains (andre *.sundaysuite.app-apper).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
